    <UnitTestResult executionId="21d613d9-0d79-44be-b5d1-8cda75aef912" testId="c97625b2-b8ec-7084-9840-77927f20239f" testName="OutsideInfoArgumentOffersNoCompletion(&quot;AES-CBC&quot;)" computerName="HOMEDEVICE" duration="00:00:00.0000699" startTime="2026-10-18T17:14:08.8228508+02:00" endTime="2026-10-18T17:14:08.8229211+02:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="21d613d9-0d79-44be-b5d1-8cda75aef912" />
    <UnitTestResult executionId="3cd2e95f-7006-4fc0-8acc-3a85262d7fc2" testId="1802ce61-27c7-4c50-fe45-62aa02649636" testName="CompletionDescriptionsComeFromInfoCompletionData(&quot;mechanisms&quot;,&quot;Lists all supported cryptographic mechanisms.&quot;)" computerName="HOMEDEVICE" duration="00:00:00.0000050" startTime="2026-10-18T17:14:08.8138287+02:00" endTime="2026-10-18T17:14:08.8138332+02:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="3cd2e95f-7006-4fc0-8acc-3a85262d7fc2" />
    <UnitTestResult executionId="c52fda34-c66d-41e7-b240-65878b220d63" testId="b661785d-ee77-f208-2a79-1dce9938c212" testName="RenderedMatrixLinkAndBackNavigateThroughActualView(3,0)" computerName="HOMEDEVICE" duration="00:00:00.0072140" startTime="2026-10-18T17:14:09.1161953+02:00" endTime="2026-10-18T17:14:09.1234086+02:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="c52fda34-c66d-41e7-b240-65878b220d63">
      <Output>
        <StdOut># PCI PIN-block translations&#xD;
&#xD;
`Info(pintranslations)` opens this matrix. `PinBlockTranslate(sourceParams, sourceKey, encryptedPinBlock, targetParams, targetKey)` decrypts and validates internally, builds the target format and returns only the encrypted target block as VAR.&#xD;
&#xD;
| Position | Argument | Contract |&#xD;
