&#xD;
PCI PIN Security Requirements and Testing Procedures, Version 3.1, Requirement 3-3. See [PCI Information Supplement: Implementing ISO Format 4 PIN Blocks, September 2021, Figure 3.5, page 10](https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/documents/Implementing_ISO_Format_4_PIN_Blocks_Information_Supplement.pdf).&#xD;
